  "title": "ChangeTrust whose line is the native asset, accepted before Protocol 10 and failed with txINTERNAL_ERROR",
  "kind": "ledger",
  "caps": [],
  "caps_note": "A classic operation rule older than the CAP process: stellar-core rejects a native trust line at validation from Protocol 10 (ChangeTrustOpFrame::doCheckValid); before that the operation reached apply",
